sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor T as Tester
  participant ED as Scenario editor
  participant API as Lab API
  participant M as Scenario.from_dict
  participant REG as ScenarioRegistry
  participant F as custom.json

  T->>ED: New scenario: title, steps, expected HIGH
  ED->>API: POST /api/scenarios {scenario JSON}
  API->>REG: create(data)
  REG->>M: validate (path under /demo/, methods, repeat ≤ 50, ≤ 100 requests)
  alt invalid
    M-->>API: ScenarioError("Path must start with /demo/ ...")
    API-->>ED: 400 + message shown in the editor
  else valid
    REG->>REG: unique id "custom-..."
    REG->>F: atomic write under a lock
    REG-->>API: Scenario
    API-->>ED: 201 scenario
    ED-->>T: new card in its group, ready to Run
  end
